{
 "meta": {
  "document": "Ashley County 2026 adopted budget",
  "title": "Ashley County — the money trail",
  "year": 2026,
  "grand_total": 14434336.48,
  "note": "This is Ashley County's 2026 budget book as filed with the state, a scanned copy with an appropriation summary and one 'Appropriation for 2026' page per office. We use each office's page total. County General shows its printed summary total of $6,409,281.00, but its office pages add to $7,947,084.00, because the summary lists the jail at only $63,297. Five funds list transfers out ($1,822,092.58 in all) without saying where the money goes, so some of those dollars may be counted again in another fund."
 },
