   "layer": "appropriation",
   "docket_ref": null,
   "note": "Printed total (Appropriation Summary, p. 8) is $6,409,281.00; the department pages listed add to $7,947,084.00. The summary lists County Jail at $63,297.00 (the same as Coroner) and Sheriff at $2,068,196.00, but the Jail page (p. 45) prints $1,476,515.00 and the Sheriff page (p. 36) prints $2,192,781.00; both pages' line items add to those totals."
  },
